<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Satellite cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Satellite cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs downgraded U.S. Satellite Broadcasting Co to market perform from outperform, a source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Satellite lost 5/8 to 10-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
